---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Chauffeur Emillan Katour"
  description="Privacy policy for Chauffeur Emillan Katour Sri Lanka private tours."
>
  <div class="pt-28 pb-20 section-wrap max-w-3xl">
    <h1 class="section-title mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-forest max-w-none text-warmgray leading-relaxed space-y-6">
      <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-GB', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</p>
      <p>Chauffeur Emillan Katour ("we", "Emil", "our") respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal information we collect, how we use it, and your rights.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-forest-700 mt-8">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We collect information you provide when contacting us (name, email, phone, travel dates), and standard web analytics data (pages visited, device type). We do not sell your data to any third party.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-forest-700 mt-8">How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>To respond to tour enquiries, prepare personalised itineraries, confirm bookings, and send relevant travel information. We will never send unsolicited marketing without your consent.</p>
      <h2 class="font-display text-xl text-forest-700 mt-8">Contact</h2>
      <p>For any privacy concerns, contact Emil directly at <a href="mailto:emil@chauffeuremillankatour.com" class="text-forest-600 underline">emil@chauffeuremillankatour.com</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
